sub2api adaptations:
- backend/internal/accountquality/scorer.go adapts the candy question from
  server.py, clarifies fixed shape selection, and adds a versioned answer plus
  user-facing solution summary format with strict answer parsing.
- frontend/src/components/admin/account-quality/qualityMonitor.ts derives its
  monitor timeline and statistics layout from app/web/app.js and app/server.py.
  It adds typed inputs, per-policy/evidence-scope filtering, run deduplication,
  an exact rolling window, and separate answer accuracy/coverage calculations.
  It is a presentation-data module and does not change runtime scheduling.
- backend/internal/accountquality/suite.go adapts the SVG animation prompt,
  structural validation and four-criterion visual review from server.py and
  visual_review.py, adding strict parsing, safe SVG and expiring evidence.
- deploy/quality-renderer/renderer.py adapts render_frames.py with authenticated
  HTTP access, bounded subprocesses, blocked network and four timed PNG frames.
- QualityResultsPanel.vue adapts the visual results layout with paginated SVG
  artwork, per-stage results and accessible clickable history blocks.

Modified files carry their own source and change notices. The original source
